(APO TON PROLOGO STEN ELLENIKE EKDOSE)
H EUROPAIKE KRITIKE
GIA TE GERMANIKE EKDOSE TOU ERGOU
o Kondules egrapse ena semantiko biblio, to opoio, pro pantos khare sten antiparathese tou me ten kathieromene ereuna, anekei sta gonimotera pragmata pou graphtekan gia te theoria tou polemou meta ton Deutero Pagkosmio Polemo. Esphaxe polles <>tes dutikophileleutheres istorikes kai politikes epistemes.
Der Staat (Berolino)
O Kondules petukhe kata entuposiako tropo na ermeneusei apo nea skopia ton Clausewitz kai na deixei te diastase ekeine tes skepses tou pou tha mporousame na kharakterisoume os politike philosophia... To basiko epiteugma tou neou bibliou tou Kondule einai mia kainourgia ermeneia tou Clausewitz e opoia peithei ton anagnoste toso apo ten apopse tou periekhomenou oso kai me ten austere sullogistike tes
Etappe (Phrankphourte)
Opos oi proegoumenes ergasies tou Kondule, etsi kai auto to biblio kharakterizetai apo ten exairetike ikanoteta na sunduazei te duname tes theoretikes epexergasias me te sustematike anakataskeue ton istorikon phainomenon, xekinontas apo ena antikeimeno eidiko, opos o polemos, alla sunama kentriko logo tes semasias kai tes epikairotetas tou.
Filosofia Politica (Mpolonia)
Tha mporouse na milesei kaneis gia mian epanastase sten ermeneia tou Clausewitz... upsiste ermeneutike dexiotekhnia... Khoris ten paramikre amphibolia, e melete tou Kondule diekdikei ta skeptra tes mones egkures ermeneias tou Clausewitz apo to antistoikho ergo tou Raymond Aron.
Neue Zilrcher Zeitung (Zurikhe)
O Kondules egrapse anamphibola ena biblio pou mas leei dusaresta pragmata. Alla akribos gi' auto einai ena semantiko biblio.
Der Standard (Bienne)"—	
”	Dear Listener,
Mercury's in retrograde, and folks in Beaumont, South Carolina, are dealing with gossip, scandal, misunderstandings, and more secrets than ever. Local pediatrician Maggie Farnsworth has even bigger worries. Her wild-girl past has caught up with her in the form of her ex-boyfriend, a jailbird who just flew the coopand is bent on tracking down Maggie and her daughter. Fortunately, FBI agent Zack Madden is on hand for protection. Unfortunately, his presence is turning up the heat on an attraction Maggie simply has no time foror does she? But Maggie and Zack aren't the only ones getting busy: Fleas, the hound dog, is up to his old tricksthis time with Butterbean, a very alluringgoat? Jamie Swift and millionaire Max Holt have babies on the brain. And resident psychic-slash-astrologer Destiny is fighting a crush of her own. Since the town's ice cream parlor is a magnet for gossip, no one can keep a secret and the sticky situations are even stickier.
It's the wildest time yet in the town we love to write about, with the characters we can't get enough of. So sit back, relax, and enjoy a Full Scoopof fun, adventure, and romance.
Janet and Charlotte"™
–The sonic has come to occupy center stage in the arts and humanities. In the age of computational media, sound and its subcultures can offer more dynamic ways of accounting for bodies, movements, and events. In The Rhythmic Event, Eleni Ikoniadou explores traces and potentialities prompted by the sonic but leading to contingent and unknowable forces outside the periphery of sound. She investigates the ways in which recent digital art experiments that mostly engage with the virtual dimensions of sound suggest alternate modes of perception, temporality, and experience. Ikoniadou draws on media theory, digital art, and philosophical and technoscientific ideas to work toward the articulation of a media philosophy that rethinks the media event as abstract and affective.
The Rhythmic Event seeks to define the digital media artwork as an assemblage of sensations that outlive the space, time, and bodies that constitute and experience it. Ikoniadou proposes that the notion of rhythm--detached, however, from the idea of counting and regularity -- can unlock the imperceptible, aesthetic potential enveloping the artwork. She speculates that addressing the event on the level of rhythm affords us a glimpse into the nonhuman modalities of thought proper to the digital and hidden in the gaps between strict definitions (e.g., human/sonic/digital) and false dichotomies (e.g., virtual/real). Operating at the margins of perception, the rhythmic artwork summons an obscure zone of sonic thought, which considers the event according to its power to become." 
Los Antzeles, 2019. E Ntetektib Tzenipher Gkaphrei tou LAPD enonei tis dunameis tes me ton idiotiko ntetektib kai phanatiko tainion epistemonikes phantasias Ntik Philipo gia na lusei mia alusida phonon. Ola ta thumata einai ethopoioi tes dekaetias tou '80. Oloi dolophonethekan molis anakoinotheke e epistrophe tous se sikouel ton tainion pou tous ekanan diasemous. Oloi etoimazontan na doulepsoun gia ton paragogo B. B. Eightiz. E upothese peripleketai otan mia "nekre" ethopoios emphanizetai xaphnika sto grapheio tou Ntik olozontane kai se neare elikia kai o B. B. Eightiz anakoinonei allo ena sikouel, arkhizontas ten antistrophe metrese gia ten epomene dolophonia."£

 
"Kuriake 9.25 M.M.
To periekhomeno tou surtariou einai aplomeno sto grapheio tou Khalkide. Enas asemenios anapteras Zipo me ta arkhika tou* to proto doro pou tou eikhe kanei. Mia photographia tous sta kamarinia tou arkhaiou theatrou ton Philippon. Ta makria maura gantia pou phorouse stis "Doules". Ena plake mpoukali Dewar's pou tou to 'khe petaxei katakephala sto domatio 603 tou xenodokheiou "Galaxy" sten Patra. Duo apokommata eisiterion tou kinematographou "Trianon", "E tautoteta mias gunaikas" tou Antonioni, oi monadikoi theates sten aithousa, exo khionize. Ena paketo Player's* ta ikhne tou kokkinou methusmenou philiou ekhoun pia khathei. Kai ta suntoma semeiomata pou ton perimenan stis resepsion ton xenodokheion, kalokairi tou '97. Dekaennia semeiomata* den ta 'khei diabasei apo tote. Ki ena pistoli ton ennia khilioston pou lampei sto misoskotado."
Athena, kheimonas tou 2004. Mia palia monokatoikia kaigetai mazi me tous tesseris enoikous tes. Enas apotukhemenos dikegoros ki enas skleros mpatsos prospathoun na broun tous enokhous kai na pnixoun tis enokhes tous. Parallela, diekdikoun ten idia gunaika* mia moiraia ethopoio pou stoikheionei to parelthon tous. Otan suneidetopoioun pos mplekhtekan se mia skoteine istoria, anagkazontai na skalisoun tis stakhtes kai na "lerosoun" ta kheria tous."«
¨This guide traces the highly influential work of the postmodernist intellectual, Baudrillard, who has been hailed as one of the world's most subtle and powerful thinkers. His style and assaults on sociology, feminism and Marxism have exposed him to accusations of being the pimp of postmodernism."³

°
An indie phenomenon andNew York Times and USA TODAY bestseller, the first in a heartwrenching New Adult series about a beautiful young sports rehab specialist who can't fight her attraction to a dangerously sexy underground fighter.
HOT. SEXY. POWERFUL. PAINFUL. REAL. The scorching international bestseller that strips away everything you've ever believed about passion . . . . 
Remington Tate has a bad-boy rep in and out of the ring, a granite-hard body, and a raw, animal power that sends his female fans into a frenzy. But from the moment their eyes lock, the only woman he wants is Brooke Dumas. His desire is pure, all-consuming, and REAL.
Hired to keep his perfect body working like a machine, Brooke finally has the lucrative sports therapy job she's been dreaming of. But as she tours the dangerous underground fighting circuit with Remy and his team, Brooke's own body becomes alive with the most primal of hungers. If what happens between Brooke and Remy is ever as light as a flirtation, it quickly becomes an erotic obsession for them both, and promises so much more.
But their white-hot lust has a dark side--and when Remy's deepest secret comes to light and Brooke's familial duties demand action, will the pair be able to hang on, or will everything that once seemed so real suddenly fade away like an illusion?"´
±E Marika e Tatauliane, mia Politissa kura, logia ma kai mpoemissa, mesa apo ten makra aphegese tou biou tes, anapheretai parallela, allote perileptika ki allote diexodika, se peristatika kai se prosopa, me emphase sten koinonike zoe ton Romion kai ton Tourkon kai stis metaxu tous skheseis, alla kai sumpoliton tes pou anekoun se alles meionotikes omades, oi opoies sundiamorphonoun ten anthropogeographike tautoteta tes Poles tou perasmenou aiona. O logos tes diakoptetai sukhna apo sparaktika intermedia tes diataragmenes mnemes tes pou einai stoikheiomene ap' ta anepoulota traumata tes suntaraktikes gia ten politike omogeneia -ma kai gia ole ten Romiosune- epokhes tou proskhediasmenou tourkikou pogkrom tou Septembriou tou 1955 enantion kathe romaiikou stoikheiou, to opoio -me ten sunepikouria kai allon metron pou eikhan proegethei e akolouthesan ta Gegonota- odegese sten surriknose tes ellenorthodoxes koinotetas tes Konstantinoupoles."µ
²"... Apheste me na sas exegeso ti einai oi Kapa, oso ki an amphisbeteite ten uparxe tous.
To pio axiosemeioto kharakteristiko einai e epidermida tous, pou allazei sunekhos apokhroseis gia na tairiazei me to periballon. Den xepernoun se upsos to ena metro kai se baros ta dekapente kila.
Kati allo pou tha sas ekplexei einai oti phoroun gualia, khresimopoioun tsigarothekes kai sto kheri kratoun panta ena tsantaki e ena portopholi.
Telos, to pio diaskedastiko isos kharakteristiko tous einai oti de phoroun pote roukha -oute gia na kalupsoun ta gennetika tous organa.
Bebaia, enas apo autous mou eipe oti to idio diaskedastiko briskoun oi Kapa ton tropo pou emeis kanoume o,ti mporoume gia na ta skepazoume..."
E oraiotere isos noubela tou Riounosouke Akoutagkaoua, enos apo tous megaluterous logotekhnes tes Iaponias."¹
¶Eimaste tria skantaliarika xotika. Briskomaste kleismena gia polla - polla khronia sten kardia enos megalou dentrou. Mia mera to ekopsan oi nanoi ki etsi mas eleutherosan. Apo ten emera ekine brekan ton mpela tous apo mas oi kaemenoi. Giati eimaste megala peirakhteria kai mas aresoun oi zabolies kai t' asteia. To ti kaname stous nanous, tha to diabasete s'auto to biblio . Tha mathete akoma gia ta Gkousnagk...
Loipon kalo diabasma kai sas uposkhomaste oti tha sas diaskedasoume kai me to parapano. Ki an peirazoume tous philous sas tous nanous, me sas kakophainetai to kanoume giati mas aresoun t' asteia kai ta paikhnidia. Upographoume, emeis ta tria xotika.
Ksudakes - Alatakes - Piperakes"ù
öEimai enas nanos kai katoiko me merikous akome nanous sto megalo kai pukno dasos. Me lene Gladiolo. Oloi emeis oi nanoi tou megalou dasous, ekhoume onomata louloudion. Ustera apo enan tromero kataklusmo, ephthasan ste khora mas oi katoikoi enos allou dasous. Etan oloi tous sumpathetikoi kai kharitomenoi. Tous dekhtekame me agape kai tous boethesame na egkatastathoun konta mas. Tous mathame polla pragmata gia na ginei pio eukole kai omorphe e zoe tous, kai mazi tous perasame kharoumenes, axekhastes ki eutukhismenes meres. Diabaste, loipon tis istories mas. Eimai sigouros pos tha sas enthousiasoun.
Gladiolos (Apo ten ekdose)"ù
öNARNIA ... where the last king makes a stand and sad farewells turn to joy ... where adventures begin again.
The Unicorn says that humans are brought to Narnia only in time of great need - and that time is now. the Great Lion, Aslan, the heart of Narnia, is missing. An impostor roams the land in his place, enslaving Aslan's loyal creatures and spreading treachery and lies. Only King Tirian and his small band of loyal followers are left to fight the last battle in this magnificent ending to The Chronicles of Narnia.
